OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly start to a dry,
OL,6,Fbright morning with some sunny spells,
OL,7,Falthough cloud increasing. Outbreaks
OL,8,Fof occasionally heavy rain spread east
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon. Strengthening
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FOccasionally heavy rain clearing
OL,14,Fovernight then sunny spells and
OL,15,Fblustery showers Friday, the showers
OL,16,Fbecoming heavier, more frequent
OL,17,FSaturday with northwesterly coastal
OL,18,Fgales. Mainly dry and bright on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
